      "en": "「$$ノノ$$ is bad at this~. Pull back units about to be shot down, or pick evade or defend, and their survival odds go up.」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g168_01"
    },
    "168:8558": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "ff9240a519bcf106f35c9451fe8fafcc79b04f192383d0b156a883c7cf369d2d",
      "en": "「You... Don't tell me you only know 'hard work' and 'guts'...!? Typical Dumbatross...!」",
      "source": "new",
      "slice": "v_g168_01"
    },
    "168:8639": {
      "repository_source_sha256": "57010979426b12eaefa06f889dac12c2845610efa2ef77434ae795c4892d1e47",
